&lt;h3&gt;Über uns&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein unbefristeter Vertrag mit 30 Urlaubstagen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsweise: Wir legen großen Wert auf regelmäßige persönliche Zusammenarbeit im Büro, und bieten auch die Möglichkeit zum Arbeiten im Homeoffice sowie die Option, bis zu 40 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attraktive Zusatzleistungen: Wir bieten eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Sprachkurse (Englisch/Deutsch) und Mitarbeiterrabatte bei ausgewählten nachhaltigen Marken. Darüber hinaus unterstützen Dich unsere externen Partner im Bereich mentale Gesundheit, um Deine psychische Gesundheit durch anonyme Einzel- oder Gruppensitzungen zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtuelles Aktienprogramm: Profitiere von GROPYUS Erfolg durch unser Virtuelles Aktienprogramm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigenverantwortung: Du kannst wirklich etwas bewirken – auf allen Ebenen unserer Organisation. Finde Lösungen, treibe sie voran, teste und implementiere sie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Chance, Teil von etwas Großem zu sein: Unsere Mission ist es, eine ganze Branche neu zu denken. Hilf uns dabei, das Bauwesen neu zu erfinden und nachhaltiges, erschwingliches Wohnen zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein vielfältiges und bereicherndes Arbeitsumfeld: Werde ein geschätztes Mitglied eines wunderbar vielfältigen Teams von Menschen aus über 50 Ländern. Bei GROPYUS legen wir großen Wert auf Inklusion und sorgen dafür, dass sich jeder – unabhängig von seinem Hintergrund – als Teil der Gemeinschaft fühlt. So werden unsere Unterschiede zu Stärken, die uns als Team weiterbringen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, and if you have any questions, please reach out to us via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are growing our Data Platform Team within the Gropyus Tech department. Our Platform team is responsible for features and operating our internal platform, the Gropyus Data Fabric.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team interacts with experts from various domains such as Digital Building Planning and Automation, Product Operations, Sustainability, AI, IoT, construction engineers, building architects, logistics experts, software engineering; solving complex challenges pertaining to end-to-end process for planning, building, and operating a building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As part of the Data Platform organization, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain core data platform components, including ingestion frameworks, transformation pipelines, and data storage layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and improve data reliability through monitoring, alerting, SLAs, and data quality checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with domain experts and software engineers to understand data needs and deliver high-quality datasets through managed data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to initiatives to modernize or scale our data ecosystem (including query optimization, schema design, analytics, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to best practices and rigor in development including documentation, testing, and validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;About You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a tech stack similar to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming languages like Python or Kotlin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databases like Postgres, BigQuery, Graph DB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tools like: Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, Dagster, DBT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD: Azure Devops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observability &amp;amp; Monitoring: Graphana, Honeycomb&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to complete work as directed with guidance from senior engineers or leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience resolving issues related to pipeline health, platform features and testing for prevention and handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in creating, operating, and scaling data intensive reactive processing pipelines from end to end including ingestion, storage, orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience following best practice guidelines in data and software engineering including monitoring and observation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optional Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Machine Learning and AI agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database Administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be part of something big:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You’re here to make a change? Come on board. At GROPYUS, we are on a mission to re-think an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and sustainable, affordable living.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;It’s on you:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;We offer a tremendous amount of ownership and room to make a mark - at all our organization levels. Find your solutions, drive and test them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Focus on results:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You choose if you work from home, a park, or the office. Whether you start your day early, after your run, or pick up on work when your kids are in bed. What counts is your contribution and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bring your uniqueness to the team&lt;/em&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Innovation requires diversity of thought. Diversity in background, experience and thinking is crucial to create the best product for everyone. We actively seek diversity and strive to unlock each other’s full potential. We are very proud that people from all industries and all walks of life are joining our company – in addition to core areas such as construction, engineering, and start-ups, from stock-listed companies from across automotive e-Commerce, digital, sporting goods, and more. You will work in international teams with passionate colleagues. Inspire and be inspired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be an owner:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;Participate in the success of GROPYUS through stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, and if you have any questions, please reach out to us via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Remote is solving modern organizations’ biggest challenge – navigating global employment compliantly with ease. We make it possible for businesses of all sizes to recruit, pay, and manage international teams. With our core values at heart and future focused work culture, our team works tirelessly on ambitious problems, asynchronously, around the world. You can find Remoters working from 6 different continents (Antarctica left to go!) and all of our positions are fully remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-2f7cb4da-dab4-8068-a80f-001c50b2d808 suggestion-update notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;With Innovation as one of the core values, we have built Automation and AI capabilities into the requirements for every role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage every member of the Remote team to bring their talents, experiences and culture to the table to help us build the best-in-class HR platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are energetic, curious, motivated and ambitious, be part of our world. Apply now and define the future of work!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What this job can offer you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting time to join Remote and make a personal difference in the global employment space as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Sales - Account Management (Existing Customer Expansion)&lt;/strong&gt;, joining our &lt;strong&gt;Global Expansion team within the Go-To-Market (GTM) organization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead a high-performing team of Senior Account Managers responsible for growing and retaining our Mid-Market and Enterprise customer base across EMEA. You&#39;ll own the daily operating rhythm of the business—forecasting, coaching, deal strategy, and execution—while creating an environment where people are challenged, supported, and inspired to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires more than commercial excellence. We&#39;re looking for a leader who develops people, builds strong cross-functional partnerships, and creates momentum during periods of change. You recognize problems quickly—but more importantly, you help teams solve them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Commercial Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in Account Management or Existing Business leadership, ideally within Mid-Market and Enterprise segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading quota-carrying sales teams with responsibility for forecasting, pipeline management, performance coaching, and revenue attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop high-performing Account Managers through coaching, feedback, and structured development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as a hands-on leader—jumping into strategic customer conversations, negotiations, and deal coaching when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong forecasting discipline with the ability to identify risks, opportunities, and trends early through data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining, measuring, and presenting sales metrics and business performance to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving pipeline rigor, operational excellence, and predictable revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce and modern sales technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine coaching mindset with a passion for helping others grow and succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trust quickly and develops strong partnerships across Product, RevOps, Customer Success, Acquisition Sales, Marketing, Finance, and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and leading confidently through change, helping others stay focused on execution rather than uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally optimistic and solutions-oriented. You raise risks thoughtfully, challenge ideas constructively, and instinctively pair problems with practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates positive energy within teams. You elevate the people around you through collaboration, accountability, and encouragement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes ownership beyond your immediate team, proactively identifying opportunities to improve how the broader organization operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Celebrates team success over individual recognition and contributes positively to the broader leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently delivers strong business outcomes while building a healthy, sustainable, and high-performing team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the daily operating rhythm of the Account Management team through effective pipeline reviews, forecast calls, one-on-ones, deal coaching, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed team revenue goals while developing a high-performing organization capable of sustained success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and empower Senior Account Managers to maximize customer value, improve commercial execution, and grow in their careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the business by supporting strategic negotiations, joining key customer conversations, and helping remove obstacles that accelerate deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of accountability, ownership, and continuous improvement where high standards and strong support coexist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a solutions-first mindset by helping the team confront difficult challenges honestly, identify practical paths forward, and execute with urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve sales processes, operational efficiency, and customer outcomes across the broader Existing Business organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted partnerships with Product, RevOps, Customer Success, Finance, Marketing, and Acquisition Sales to improve customer experience and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent forecasting accuracy, pipeline hygiene, account prioritization, and sales execution across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly analyze business performance to identify trends, risks, opportunities, and actionable insights for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide weekly, monthly, and quarterly reporting on pipeline health, forecast accuracy, customer expansion, wins, losses, and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a team culture where collaboration, curiosity, resilience, and continuous learning are expected and celebrated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a role model for Remote&#39;s values by creating alignment, building trust, and helping the broader organization succeed—not just your own team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Practical&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP, Expansion Revenue &lt;em&gt;(interim, pending broader Existing Business organizational changes)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Global Expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Region:&lt;/strong&gt; EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; M4&lt;/li&gt;
