&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt; Conceptual Creative Lead - Art Director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; London, United Kingdom &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Creative Lead (Art), you&#39;ll own the creative vision across all integrated campaigns for the client&#39;s Durex team — from conceiving compelling concepts and setting visual direction, to overseeing production, reviewing output, and presenting work to clients with strategic confidence. You&#39;ll lead and mentor the creative team, build strong client relationships, and bring a proactive, solutions-focused approach to every brief. Great creative needs both freedom and structure to thrive — and you understand how to create the conditions for both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Direction &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the creative vision and art direction across all integrated campaigns — video, photography, graphic design, digital, and social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling creative concepts and campaign ideas that drive brand engagement and deliver measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create comprehensive creative briefs and visual guidelines to communicate direction clearly to internal teams and external creative resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push creative boundaries while maintaining brand integrity, platform suitability, and client requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent visual standards and brand identity across all deliverables and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Execution&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with digital, video, and photography producers to execute creative vision across integrated campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee creative production workflows and timelines, ensuring all deliverables meet creative and technical standards and land on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve all creative output for quality, brand alignment, and platform optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify production constraints early and problem-solve creatively within those parameters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present creative work to clients with confidence, clarity, and strategic rationale — acting as a trusted creative advisor throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate client needs and proactively suggest creative solutions and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage creative feedback and revisions while maintaining the integrity of the creative direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate clients on creative processes and best practice where relevant, building their understanding and confidence in the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, brief, and mentor the creative team — including designers, art directors, and junior creatives — fostering a culture of craft, ambition, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to post-project analysis and learnings, ensuring creative output is measured against objectives and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the ongoing development of the team&#39;s creative capabilities and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate client briefs and marketing objectives into effective, insight-led creative strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to social and content strategy development from a creative perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with platform trends, competitor activity, and emerging creative technologies — bringing relevant thinking to the team and client proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and analytics to inform, refine, and justify creative approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
