&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of CMSs, e-commerce platforms, or digital publishing is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project-level creative budgets in collaboration with producers — including awareness of cost implications across video, photography, and digital production workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with producers to source and manage external creative resources within agreed budget parameters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag budget risks early and contribute to cost-effective creative decision-making without compromising output quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert use of Gen AI tools relevant to creative direction and art — including image generation, ideation, concept development, and visual research — to enhance output quality and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting quality benchmarks for AI-assisted creative output within a team context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to train and guide others in effective AI tool use for creative disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic thinking for complex, multi-deliverable campaign challenges — you break problems down systematically and create clear paths from brief to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of when AI enhances creative craft and when human judgement and authorship must lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal qualifications are welcome but not required. Equivalent experience — gained through work, self-directed learning, or other routes — counts equally.&lt;/li&gt;
